    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Asthma is on the rise in Pakistan,\" revealed Dr. Javaid A. Khan, Associate Professor & Consultant Chest Physician at the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH). He was giving a presentation on \"Asthma - A Global Health Problem\" at 'Signs, Symptoms and Care' a monthly health awareness programme held on April 29, 2000, on the occasion of the forthcoming Asthma Day.",
